<title>MALAYSIA: MAS says to raise 1.5 bln rgt from bonds.</title>
<headline>MAS says to raise 1.5 bln rgt from bonds.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian Airline System Bhd said on Thursday it was planning to issue five-year bonds to raise 1.5 bilion ringgit with detachable warrants.</p>
<p>It said in a statement to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange that the one percent 1997/2002 unsecured bonds will have 770 million detachable warrants</p>
<p>The warrants will represent 100 percent of the nominal value of the bonds, said Malaysian Airlines</p>
<p>The statement said the issue has been cleared by Malaysia's central bank, Bank Negara.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
